# Kitesail Corsair: "This creature has flying as long as it's attacking" (CR 506.4, 604.1, 702.9). Bot1 casts it with Black Lotus's {U}{U}{U}
# (it has no flying then). Bot2's Runeclaw Bear, cast with its own Lotus, has no flying or reach. When the Corsair attacks on turn 3 it
# has flying, so the Bear may not block it (CR 702.9b) and Bot2 takes 2. After combat it has no flying again.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Kitesail Corsair
Island x22

[Bot2 Deck]
Black Lotus
Runeclaw Bear
Island x22

